{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supermarket Simulator Deluxe</strong> is an entertaining and challenging simulation game where you take on the role of a supermarket owner. <br>Your tasks include:<br> <br>1.)ordering and restocking goods. <br>2.)managing inventory. <br>3.)operating the cash register. <br>4.)expanding and designing your store.  <br><br>To run your supermarket successfully and grow it continuously, you'll need to focus on profitability, customer satisfaction, and efficient workflows at all times.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725710?t=1765317390","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3725710?t=1765317390","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725710/cd10d96815838b9b84806427bbc7212010dd2ccb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765317390","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725710/cd10d96815838b9b84806427bbc7212010dd2ccb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765317390","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supermarket Simulator Deluxe</strong> is an entertaining and challenging simulation game where you take on the role of a supermarket owner. <br>Your tasks include:<br> <br>1.)ordering and restocking goods. <br>2.)managing inventory. <br>3.)operating the cash register. <br>4.)expanding and designing your store.  <br><br>To run your supermarket successfully and grow it continuously, you'll need to focus on profitability, customer satisfaction, and efficient workflows at all times.</p>","developers":["MasterHanzi"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3725710/66df7a03305a4bbe2d3b0b0116dbcab4e89985fb/header.jpg?